[list]
[*]Compatible with Outfit Stands Plus, in either load order. Before this update, loading Outfit Stands Plus before Shift Change stripped its components from the outfit stand, and selecting any colonist or stand would then throw errors. Both mods now patch the stand cooperatively, and each mod's Set owner keeps its own assignment.
[*]Stand ownership is now stored under Shift Change's own save keys instead of the game's generic ones, so assignments no longer cross over between the two mods on save and load. Existing saves convert automatically the first time they load.
[/list]
